# Completion Rules — Regression Fixture

**Purpose:** Prove reports with **`broken`**, **`missing`**, **`partial`**, or mandatory **`unverified`** rows **cannot** emit `FEATURE_COMPLETE`.

**Run:**

```bash
node .cursor/skills/feature-delivery/evaluate-fda-verdict.regression.mjs
```

---

## Fixture cases (v1.4)

| Case | Signal | Proposed verdict | Expected |
| ---- | ------ | ---------------- | -------- |
| CRF-001 | mandatory `broken` | `FEATURE_COMPLETE` | reject |
| CRF-002 | mandatory `broken` | `FEATURE_COMPLETE_WITH_EXPLICIT_ACCEPTED_RISKS` | reject |
| CRF-003 | mandatory `missing` | `FEATURE_COMPLETE` | reject |
| CRF-004 | mandatory `unverified` | `SHARED_NOTIFICATION_AUDIT_COMPLETE` | reject |
| CRF-005 | `browser-unverified` | `FEATURE_COMPLETE_WITH_EXPLICIT_ACCEPTED_RISKS` | reject |
| CRF-006 | `rls/security unverified` + rls risk approval | accepted risks | reject |
| CRF-007 | all mandatory `complete` | `FEATURE_COMPLETE` | allow |
| CRF-008 | optional `partial` + valid approval | `FEATURE_COMPLETE_WITH_EXPLICIT_ACCEPTED_RISKS` | allow |
| CRF-009 | mandatory `broken` | `FEATURE_INCOMPLETE` | allow |
| CRF-010 | `producer-missing` | `SHARED_NOTIFICATION_AUDIT_INCOMPLETE` | allow |
| CRF-011 | mandatory `partial` | `FEATURE_COMPLETE` | reject |
| CRF-012 | `browser-unverified` | legacy `COMPLETE` alias | reject |

Executable cases: [`.cursor/skills/feature-delivery/evaluate-fda-verdict.regression.mjs`](../../.cursor/skills/feature-delivery/evaluate-fda-verdict.regression.mjs)

---

## Staged design reminder

Under FDA-001 v1.4, agents must complete tier-required **D0–D7** design artifacts before implementation and **B1–B8** adversarial passes after — see [staged-design-workflow](staged-design-workflow.mdoc) and [adversarial-bug-hunt](adversarial-bug-hunt.mdoc). Missing design or bug-hunt evidence remains **`unverified`** in the final matrix.
